  "RHI": "Carnival Spielmannszug and brass, hunting horns, Holy Week Klappern.",
  "SWA": "Blasmusik (clarinet and brass), accordion clubs, Fasnet Schellen and Raetschen, Black Forest fair organs. Harmonica left out: it is made there but has little folk use.",
